","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1054","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[86,79,71,60,57,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"16050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1002305","helmet":"WP1021705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[86,79,71,60,57,80],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"16050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1002305","helmet":"WP1021705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将，朱治养子。吕蒙袭取荆州时登场，协助潘璋擒获关羽。吕蒙死后，朱然代替吕蒙镇守江陵。刘备伐吴时与孙桓一同出战，但被蜀将吴班所败。陆逊发起火攻时奉命起火，并追击落荒而逃的刘备大军。最终官至左大司马、右军师。赤乌十二年，朱然病逝，年六十八。孙权为其素服举哀。","tc":"吳國武將，朱治養子。呂蒙襲取荊州時登場，協助潘璋擒獲關羽。呂蒙死后，朱然代替呂蒙鎮守江陵。劉備伐吳時與孫桓一同出戰，但被蜀將吳班所敗。陸遜發起火攻時奉命起火，并追擊落荒而逃的劉備大軍。最終官至左大司馬、右軍師。赤烏十二年，朱然病逝，年六十八。孫權為其素服舉哀。","en":"An officer of Wu and adopted son of Zhu Zhi. He appeared during Lu Meng's seizure of Jing Province, assisting Pan Zhang in capturing Guan Yu. After Lu Meng's death, Zhu Ran replaced him as guardian of Jiangling. When Liu Bei invaded Wu, Zhu Ran and Sun Huan marched together, but were defeated by the Shu general Wu Ban. When Lu Xun launched his fire attack, Zhu Ran was ordered to set fires and pursued Liu Bei's fleeing army. He ultimately rose to Left Grand Minister and Right Military Advisor. In the 12th year of Chiwu (249), Zhu Ran died of illness at sixty-eight. Sun Quan wore mourning clothes to honor him.","jp":"呉の武将で、朱治の養子。呂蒙が荊州を急襲した際に登場し、潘璋を補佐して関羽を捕らえた。呂蒙の死後は、朱然が呂蒙に代わって江陵を守備した。劉備が呉を伐った際には孫桓とともに出陣したが、蜀将の呉班に敗れた。陸遜が火攻めを仕掛けた際には命を受けて火を放ち、敗走する劉備の大軍を追撃した。最終的に官位は左大司馬、右軍師に至った。赤烏十二年、朱然は病没した。享年六十八。孫権は素服を着て哀悼の意を表した。","kr":"오나라의 무장이자 주치의 양자이다. 여몽이 형주를 기습했을 때 등장하여 반장을 도와 관우를 사로잡았다. 여몽 사후에는 그를 대신하여 강릉을 지켰다. 유비가 오나라를 침공했을 때 손환과 함께 출전했으나 촉장 오반에게 패했다. 육손이 화공을 펼칠 때 명을 받아 불을 질렀으며, 황급히 달아나는 유비의 대군을 추격했다. 최종 관직은 좌대사마, 우군사에 이르렀다. 적오 12년, 68세의 나이로 병사하자 손권은 소복을 입고 애도했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10095","remark":"","surname":"朱","surnameTc":"朱","surnameEn":"Zhu","surnameJp":"朱","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"然","nameTc":"然","nameEn":"Ran","nameJp":"然","nameKr":"연","nameOther":"","word":"义封","wordTc":"義封","wordEn":"Yifeng","wordJp":"義封","wordKr":"의봉","wordOther":"","icon":"朱然","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"196","city":"CS1054","gender":"0","rule":"86","force":"79","wise":"71","politics":"60","charm":"57","will":"80","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"21/21/68/21/21/48/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1000205;1017302","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000605;S1002405","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"8200","battleSoulPoint":"7700","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"1012315","strategy2":"1010301;1005401;1001205","professions":"3/3/0/3/2/4/3/1/0/1/3/4/5/0/5/1/0/1/1/0/0/3/2/2","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"84","loyalty":"0","reputation":"16050","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"182","show":"196","death":"249","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP10007","armor":"WP1002305","helmet":"WP1021705","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/2;1/1;18/1;57/1;10/0;30/1;3/0;26/2;9/1;45/0","father":"WJ10139/0","mother":"","children":"WJ10788/100","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10093/5","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"吴国武将，朱治养子。吕蒙袭取荆州